lasses.\n\n- $5\\in [-3]_{8}$ because $5≡-3\\,(\\text{mod}\\,8)$ $\\,✓$\n\n- $5\\in [13]_{8}$ because $5≡13\\,(\\text{mod}\\,8)$ $\\,✓$\n\n- $5\\notin [6]_{8}$ because $5≢6\\,(\\text{mod}\\,8)$ $\\,\\times $\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and II only\"."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186412975 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186152098 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "9c1fe7ea-d91e-5440-b756-37a460a18f19" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Residue Classes Containing a Given Element"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0c1d27f5-2dd8-5ee0-9c85-fa2aafc19456" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "II and III only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186412813} {:answer/id #uuid "5a19bf7b-22db-564c-aa73-f6a7de2af57f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "I only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186412847} {:answer/id #uuid "82922433-61e5-5a62-9698-a3b819a7b545" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "I, II, and III" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186412867} {:answer/id #uuid "d3d30caf-3e16-5777-b064-513d0c56a4fe" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "I and III only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186412911} {:answer/id #uuid "d4ca8877-62b9-5e77-9a0b-f311eb33c385" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "I and II only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186412912}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "0c1d27f5-2dd8-5ee0-9c85-fa2aafc19456" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "II and III only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186412813} :answer-field/id #uuid "abdf5568-4325-50d1-b367-2f8fd167e6e1" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186412946}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "d1a9f6cf-cd8d-55d6-a82c-4176e7807557" :question/math-academy-id "q-86027" :question/problem "Which of the following residue classes modulo $10$ contain the integer $-4?$\n\n- $[4]_{10}$\n- $[-14]_{10}$\n- $[6]_{10}$" :question/worked-solution "We have $-4\\in [a]_{10}$ if \n\n$$\n-4≡a\\,(\\text{mod}\\,10).\n$$\n\nLet's now consider each of the given equivalence classes.\n\n- $-4\\notin [4]_{10}$ because $-4≢4\\,(\\text{mod}\\,10)$ $\\,\\times $\n\n- $-4\\in [-14]_{10}$ because $-4≡-14\\,(\\text{mod}\\,10)$ $\\,✓$\n\n- $-4\\in [6]_{10}$ because $-4≡6\\,(\\text{mod}\\,10)$ $\\,✓$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II and III only\"."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186412966 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186152098 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "9c1fe7ea-d91e-5440-b756-37a460a18f19" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Residue Classes Containing a Given Element"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "141ec379-3ffa-52e6-bad6-ca1691d2141a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "II only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186412818} {:answer/id #uuid "575da76a-a021-573e-9647-5cecb1252317" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "I and II only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186412844} {:answer/id #uuid "90050eab-d210-5e6f-ab25-dd473065930c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "II and III only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186412875} {:answer/id #uuid "cf29b9c2-05c6-5263-a0ab-8a4e2db19757" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "I, II, and III" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186412906} {:answer/id #uuid "def92c9e-e6e2-5c8e-91e7-4b7fb21509ef" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "I and III only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186412917}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "57